# Real MeshCore: exchange adverts, message a node, get the ACK and a reply.
# both-modes
node Bob 7.5 echo
as Bob advert
wait 3000
expect contacts 1
# Advertise ourselves (zero hop) from the menu so Bob can decrypt our DMs.
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
key right
shot net-contacts
key enter
type Hello Bob, radio check
key enter
wait 2000
expect status delivered
shot net-dm-delivered
wait 4000
shot net-dm-reply
expect threads 1
# Bob's reply arrived while the chat was open: still one chime for it.
expect sounds 1
dump
# A long message: the chats list has all of it (its stored preview is cut short).
hold esc 900
as Bob dm Card Meet at the trailhead at 9, then up the ridge road to the Hilltop repeater; bring water.
wait 3000
expect lastmsg up the ridge road to the Hilltop repeater; bring water.
shot net-chats-long
